{
  "uid": "jammy-db",
  "title": "PostgreSQL",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "tags": [
    "jammy",
    "postgresql"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(pg_up{job=\"postgres\"}, site)",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "Site",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "site",
        "options": [],
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(pg_up{job=\"postgres\"}, site)",
          "refId": "StandardVariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PostgreSQL status",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_up{job=\"postgres\",site=~\"$site\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**DB 접속 가능 여부**\n\n- 1 = 정상, 0 = 중단"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PostgreSQL role",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_replication_is_replica{job=\"postgres\",site=~\"$site\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} (1 = replica)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**DB 역할**\n\n- 0 = 원본(쓰기), 1 = 복제본(읽기)\n- 정상: A = 0, B·C = 1\n- 0이 두 개 이상 → 이중 원본, 즉시 DB 담당 확인"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Streaming replicas",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count by (site) (pg_stat_replication_pg_wal_lsn_diff{job=\"postgres\",site=~\"$site\",state=\"streaming\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**원본에 붙은 복제본 수**\n\n- 정상: 2 (B·C)\n- 1 이하 → 복제본 끊김"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Replication lag (bytes)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_stat_replication_pg_wal_lsn_diff{job=\"postgres\",site=~\"$site\",state=\"streaming\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} {{application_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**복제 지연 (데이터 양)**\n\n- 정상: 0 근처\n- 계속 증가 → 복제본이 못 따라옴"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Replication lag (seconds)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_replication_lag_seconds{job=\"postgres\",site=~\"$site\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**복제 지연 (시간)**\n\n- 쓰기가 없으면 지연 없이도 값이 커짐\n- bytes 패널과 같이 판단"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Replication slot active",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_replication_slot_slot_is_active{job=\"postgres\",site=~\"$site\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} {{slot_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**복제 슬롯 사용 여부**\n\n- 1 = 복제본 연결 중\n- 0 지속 → 원본 WAL이 쌓임"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "WAL retained by slot",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_replication_slots_pg_wal_lsn_diff{job=\"postgres\",site=~\"$site\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} {{slot_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**원본이 보관 중인 WAL 양**\n\n- 복제본이 오래 끊기면 계속 증가\n- 원본 디스크가 찰 수 있음"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Database size",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_database_size_bytes{job=\"postgres\",site=~\"$site\",datname=\"jammy\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**DB 전체 크기**\n\n- 증가 속도로 디스크 소진 시점 추정"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PostgreSQL locks",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_locks_count{job=\"postgres\",site=~\"$site\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} {{datname}} {{mode}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**현재 lock 수**\n\n- 쓰기 지연과 같이 늘면 → 경합 의심"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connections by state",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (site, state) (pg_stat_activity_count{datname=\"jammy\",site=~\"$site\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} {{state}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**DB 접속 수 (상태별)**\n\n- 최대 접속 수에 가까우면 새 연결 실패 위험"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Data VM disk used %",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (1 - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"node_datavm\",site=~\"$site\",mountpoint=~\"/|/srv/postgresql\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{job=\"node_datavm\",site=~\"$site\",mountpoint=~\"/|/srv/postgresql\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} {{mountpoint}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**Data VM 디스크 사용률**\n\n- `/srv/postgresql` = DB 데이터, `/` = OS\n- 80% 경고, 90% 위험"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Data VM disk available bytes",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 48,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"node_datavm\",site=~\"$site\",mountpoint=~\"/|/srv/postgresql\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}} {{mountpoint}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**Data VM 디스크 남은 용량**\n\n- DB 크기 증가 속도와 비교"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Data VM CPU usage",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 48,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (1 - avg by (site) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"node_datavm\",site=~\"$site\",mode=\"idle\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**Data VM CPU 사용률**\n\n- 부하 시험 중 DB CPU 한계 확인"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Data VM memory usage",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 56,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (1 - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"node_datavm\",site=~\"$site\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{job=\"node_datavm\",site=~\"$site\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{site}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "description": "**Data VM 메모리 사용률**\n\n"
    }
  ]
}
